Object.assign(messages,{"房间存档版本不兼容": "Room save version is incompatible", "房间身份失效，请重新加入": "Room session expired. Rejoin the room.", "两台设备的联机版本不同，请更新应用": "The devices use different multiplayer versions. Update both apps.", "房间码不正确": "Incorrect room code", "设备身份无效": "Invalid device identity", "牌局已经开始；请房主回到大厅后再加入": "The game has started. Ask the host to reopen the lobby before joining.", "房间已满": "Room is full", "没有此玩家的座位": "No seat for this player", "房间已关闭": "Room is closed", "缺少操作编号": "Missing action identifier", "牌局已变化，已同步最新状态，请再操作一次": "Game state updated. Please try that action again.", "请由房主操作": "Only the host can do this", "现在不能请求建议": "Advice is unavailable right now", "模型正在思考，请稍后再试": "The model is thinking. Try again shortly.", "牌局已变化，请重新计算": "The game changed. Calculate again.", "牌局已经开始": "Game already started", "至少两名玩家加入后开始": "At least two players must join before starting", "请等待所有玩家重新连接": "Wait for all players to reconnect", "请先回到大厅再移除玩家": "Return to the lobby before removing players", "没有这名玩家": "Player not found", "牌局暂停，等待房间恢复": "Game paused. Waiting for the room to recover.", "选牌内容无效": "Invalid card selection", "不支持的房间操作": "Unsupported room action", "本副翻牌与搭档": "Flipped card and partners", "本副翻牌与规则摘要": "Flipped card and rules", "请确认翻牌与搭档": "Confirm the flipped card and partners", "看清分组后开始": "Check the teams, then start", "拖 3": "Tuo 3", "拖3规则筛选": "Tuo 3 rules filter", "权重未针对拖3重训": "Weights were not retrained for Tuo 3", "翻牌": "Flipped card", "同牌": "Matching card", "两牌同家": "Both cards held by one player", "同牌配对": "Partners by matching cards", "拖三": "Tuo 3 bonus", "余牌": "Unplayed cards", "名次": "Placement", "固定打 2": "Fixed level 2", "两副牌、四人、固定打 2，红桃 2 为逢人配。没有升级或贡还。首副随机决定翻牌者，以后由上副头游翻牌；洗牌、倒牌与发牌由系统完成。": "Two decks, four players, always level 2. Heart 2 is wild. There is no level advancement or tribute. The first flipper is random; later the previous first finisher flips. The system shuffles and deals.", "翻一张非王牌：拿到这张实体牌的人先出，两张同花同点牌的持有者为搭档；两张在同一家则保留原搭档。每副配对后自动对坐，个人积分跟随玩家。": "Flip a non-joker. Its holder leads; holders of the two matching cards become partners. If one player holds both, keep the previous teams. Partners sit opposite each other and individual totals follow players.", "每副第一手不能含 3，包括用逢人配组成含 3 的牌型。此后可以出 3，但三带二全程不能带对 3。": "The first play cannot contain a 3, including wild substitutions. Later plays may use 3s, but a full house cannot use a pair of 3s as its pair.", "头游搭档为二／三／末游，胜方两人各加 3／2／1 分，负方两人各减相应分数。": "If the first finisher’s partner finishes second, third or last, both winners gain 3, 2 or 1 points respectively; both opponents lose the same amount.", "拖三须先以最大牌收回牌权，最后一手全部由 3 和红桃 2 组成。只有头游，以及头游搭档取得二游时可以拖三计分；敌家和三游均不计拖三。": "To earn a Tuo 3 bonus, first win an uncontested trick, then finish with only 3s and heart 2s. Only the first finisher and their partner finishing second qualify. Opponents and a third-place finish do not qualify.", "头游拖三后，搭档立即硬接风，其他人不能压。接风首手不能含 3；仅剩纯三（含红桃 2）或含 3 的同花顺时，可以整手出完。仅剩含 3 的普通顺子须拆开出。仅剩纯三接风出完视为拖三成功。": "After a first-place Tuo 3 finish, the partner leads immediately and opponents cannot overtake that final play. The new lead cannot contain 3s unless the entire hand is only 3s/heart 2s or a straight flush containing 3. An ordinary straight containing 3 must be split. Finishing with only 3s/heart 2s on this inherited lead qualifies for the bonus.", "拖三时每张红桃 3、红桃 2 各计 2 分，其他 3 各计 1 分。结束时所有未出完者的这些分牌按同值扣分。每项加减都由本副两名搭档共同承担，另一队反向加减；四人总积分之和保持为 0。": "Heart 3 and heart 2 count 2 points each; other 3s count 1. Unplayed point cards incur equal penalties at the end. Every adjustment applies to both partners and the opposite adjustment to the other team. The four totals sum to zero."});
